      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i just wasted everything. 20 years of my life... my business, my marriage, all of it just gone because of some bad luck and one stupid mistake. i look in the mirror and i dont even see a person anymore, just a massive mistake. it feels like there's nothing left to even try for.",
