      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel that sense of finality when something so significant evaporates. Even when the external structures feel gone, you still possess an inner strength and countless untapped potential within yourself. Instead of thinking about rebuilding the old foundation, perhaps we can look for a new, smaller one to begin laying, one focused purely on care and small moments of peace. Please consider finding support to help navigate this profound sense of emptiness and pointlessness.",
      "source": "target",
