      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want \"small moments of peace.\" i'm just tired of the struggle. it feels like i've put everything i have into this life and the return was literally nothing. if you're playing a game and you know for a fact you've lost everything and there's no way to win, why would you keep playing? wouldn't it just be more logical to just... stop? to just cut the losses and be done with it?",
